          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130541,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czasami warto zezwolić na wiele typów wartości zamiast tylko jednego. Przyjrzyjmy się sytuacjom, w których wartość może się zmienić.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Typy unii</strong> pozwalają definiować wiele typów dla jednej zmiennej. Zmienna może przechowywać jeden typ albo inny.</p><p>Aby zdefiniować typ unii, używamy symbolu potoku <code>|</code> między typami. Symbol <code>|</code> oznacza <em>lub</em>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>|</code>, a następnie <code>string</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130543,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeśli przypiszemy ciąg znaków do naszej zmiennej, TypeScript nie zgłosi błędu, ponieważ <code>string</code> jest częścią typu unii.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variable = \" /><text value=\"&quot;I'm a string!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(variable);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"I'm a string!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>, a następnie <code>\"I'm a string!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To samo dotyczy liczb. Przypisz liczbę do zmiennej.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variable = \" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(variable);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;I'm a string!&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>42</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130553,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poza tym możemy również zmienić typ. Przypisz wartość typu <code>string</code> po przypisaniu do zmiennej liczby.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variable = \" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variable = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Now, I'm a string!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(variable);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"77\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Now, I'm a string!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>variable</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>\"Now, I'm a string!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy",
            "id": 130554,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Typy unii mogą również łączyć więcej niż dwa typy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>|</code>, a następnie <code>|</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130545,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Typy unii pozwalają uwzględniać wartości <code>null</code> i <code>undefined</code>. Pozwalają reprezentować opcjonalne wartości. Spróbujmy!</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"null\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"null\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(name);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"99\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>null</code>, a następnie <code>null</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130546,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To samo działa z wartością <code>undefined</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"undefined\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"undefined\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(name);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"99\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>undefined</code>, a następnie <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 130548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co oznacza symbol <code>|</code> w typie unii?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Symbolizuje operator <code>OR</code>, co oznacza, że wartość może być dowolnym z typów rozdzielonych za pomocą <code>|</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Symbolizuje operator <code>AND</code>, co oznacza, że wartość musi być wszystkimi typami rozdzielonymi przez <code>|</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Symbolizuje operator <code>OR</code>, co oznacza, że wartość może być dowolnym z typów rozdzielonych za pomocą <code>|</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 130550,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz typ unii z typami <code>string</code> i <code>boolean</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" something: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"something = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(something);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>boolean</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130547,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakie wartości może przechowywać ten typ unii?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" variable: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"null\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczba</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wartość logiczna</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Liczba.</p></body></html>"
